114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (The stock market, also referred to as the equity market or share bazaar, is a marketplace where shares of publicly held companies are bought and sold.  In the Philippines, the Philippine Stock Exchange \(PSE\) is the central hub for stock trading.   Understanding how the Philippine stock market  operates enables us to make informed decisions about investments and economic trends.  It is important to keep track of the stock market's value, as it has become a key platform for businesses to raise capital and serves as an indicator of a country's financial health.)
/E (The stock market, also referred to as the equity market or share bazaar, is a marketplace where shares of publicly held companies are bought and sold.  In the Philippines, the Philippine Stock Exchange \(PSE\) is the central hub for stock trading.   Understanding how the Philippine stock market  operates enables us to make informed decisions about investments and economic trends.  It is important to keep track of the stock market's value, as it has become a key platform for businesses to raise capital and serves as an indicator of a country's financial health.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
