136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 99 0 R
/T (Kakarla et al. \(2024\) predicted stock prices using the Long Short-Term Memory \(LSTM\) algorithm, Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\), and Artificial Neural Network \(ANN\). They applied these three algorithms to the Indian stock market, specifically MAANG and Divis Labs, and found that the neural network-based ANN yielded the best results, as it captures intricate, non-linear relationships and patterns. Their study revealed that while all three algorithms performed well on the dataset, the LSTM outperformed the others, with Root Mean Square Error \(RMSE\) and accuracy scores of 0.42 and 0.55, respectively.)
/E (Kakarla et al. \(2024\) predicted stock prices using the Long Short-Term Memory \(LSTM\) algorithm, Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\), and Artificial Neural Network \(ANN\). They applied these three algorithms to the Indian stock market, specifically MAANG and Divis Labs, and found that the neural network-based ANN yielded the best results, as it captures intricate, non-linear relationships and patterns. Their study revealed that while all three algorithms performed well on the dataset, the LSTM outperformed the others, with Root Mean Square Error \(RMSE\) and accuracy scores of 0.42 and 0.55, respectively.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
